\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Manipulation-check $\Delta $AUC on XES3G5M fold~0 under $p{=}0.9$ node-drop. An early pairwise$+$exercise-embedding backbone is graph-inert ($\Delta $AUC$\approx 0.0003$); the chain$+$graph-only redesign passes ($\Delta $AUC$=0.038$). The dashed line at $0.003$ is an \emph  {illustrative} floor ($\approx $10$\times $ the graph-inert noise), not a formal statistical cutoff from \cite  {daominh2026p0}.}}{19}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
